<view class="page wrong-page"><view class="wrong-hero"><view class="hero-row"><view><view class="kicker">REVIEW & GROW</view><view class="title">错题本</view></view><view class="count"><text>{{items.length}}</text><view>待复习</view></view></view><view class="muted">错题不是失误，是下一次答对的路标。</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{!items.length&&!loading}}" class="empty card"><view class="empty-icon">✓</view><view class="empty-title">今天没有待复习错题</view><view class="muted">保持住，你正在稳步前进。</view></view><view class="list"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="questionId" class="item card"><view class="item-top"><view class="number">{{index<9?'0':''}}{{index+1}}</view><view class="due"><view class="due-dot"></view>{{item.due}}</view></view><view class="item-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="item-bottom"><text>错题回顾</text><button class="master" data-id="{{item.questionId}}" bindtap="master">已掌握 <text>✓</text></button></view></view></view></view>
